          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ولیمہ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ولیمہ — valīmā — \"a wedding feast (given by the groom)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ولیمے میں بریانی تھی۔ valīme meṅ biryānī thī. There was biryani at the wedding feast."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
